Will you survive the Planes?  If you plan to use the Orb of Fate to
find the portals, then read this about Crystal Balls:

Applying a crystal ball will cause you to be immobile (in a trance) for
1 to 10 turns.

non-cursed

You may look for an object, monster or symbol (including traps and
portals, ^, but not stairs or other dungeon features). There is an
(intelligence in 20) chance of success; otherwise, you suffer the same
effects as a cursed crystal ball.

Being immobile for 1 to 10 turns on the Planes is bad bad bad.
Especially on Air and Water, where you could be enguled by an Air
Elemental or drowned by a water creature.

Unless you have INT 20, you will have a chance of failure when use the
crystal ball.

Have you tried a confused ?oGD?  If you bring at least 4, and one
expired spell, you can find all 4 portals, although the Water portal
moves, so I usually find that by stumbling into it.  But a non-confused
C?oGD will help you locate the portal on Water.  Bring a leash for your
pet if you want to take it to Astral.

You've only been to Earth so here' s some tips.  On Air, levitation and
conflict are really, really useful.  A ring of levitation is best.  You
could also ride a flying pet or drink !oLev.  You want to be very fast
on Air to avoid Elementals, so the boots are less than ideal, but
workable.

On Fire, I like Levitation because it keeps me out of the lava.  Bring
/oDig and /oCold for backup if you get stuck in it anyway.

On water, considering blessed genociding water species. You can make it
without doing that, but it is one less thing to worry about, especially
on a first ascension.

